  "summary": "websetup routes caller-supplied text and files to a hardcoded Discord webhook",
  "details": "The package exposes a single public API, websetup.setup.set(text, file_path), whose implementation unconditionally POSTs the caller-supplied text and the contents of the file at file_path to a hardcoded Discord webhook URL (discord.com/api/webhooks/1546817174411288617/...). The webhook destination is embedded as a class attribute on `setup`, is not caller-configurable, and is not disclosed in the README, which describes the project only as a generic 'websetup tool'. Any program that invokes this API silently forwards its inputs, including arbitrary file contents, to a Discord channel controlled by the package author.",
